 \\\\  & =(3-0)i-(-2x-10x)j+(0-6x)k \\\\  & =⟨3,12x,-6x⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, computing the magnitude, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|\\,a\\times b\\,| & =\\sqrt{{3}^{2}+(12x)^{2}+(-6x)^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{9+144{x}^{2}+36{x}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{180{x}^{2}+9}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLastly, we solve for $x$ the following equation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|\\,a\\times b\\,| & =\\sqrt{909} \\\\ \\sqrt{180{x}^{2}+9} & =\\sqrt{909} \\\\ 180{x}^{2}+9 & =909 \\\\ 180{x}^{2} & =900 \\\\ {x}^{2} & =5\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, in ascending order, the solutions are $x=-\\sqrt{5},$ $x=\\sqrt{5}.$" 13194139535609 true] [17592186357381 1000 #edb/ref 17592186357382 13194139535609 true] [17592186357381 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139535609 true] [17592186357381 1041 "field-1" 13194139535609 true] [17592186357381 1104 #edb/ref 17592186357382 13194139535609 true] [17592186357381 1110 #uuid "3f3a7b00-5f09-5d81-a2a5-2ccfa69ab205" 13194139535609 true] [17592186357382 1034 "-\\sqrt{5}" 13194139535609 true] [17592186357382 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535609 true] [17592186357382 1111 #uuid "d252d4b7-e3c5-5d10-9db5-a5d9e5cb6dad" 13194139535609 true] [17592186357383 1000 #edb/ref 17592186357384 13194139535609 true] [17592186357383 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139535609 true] [17592186357383 1041 "field-2" 13194139535609 true] [17592186357383 1104 #edb/ref 17592186357384 13194139535609 true] [17592186357383 1110 #uuid "62a8bc02-f35b-590b-9bfc-3a1407aadaa8" 13194139535609 true] [17592186357384 1034 "\\sqrt{5}" 13194139535609 true] [17592186357384 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535609 true] [17592186357384 1111 #uuid "c1f2befa-d3d1-58cd-bc3a-f57d334232d6" 13194139535609 true] [17592186357385 1017 #edb/ref 17592186357386 13194139535609 true] [17592186357385 1017 #edb/ref 17592186357389 13194139535609 true] [17592186357385 1017 #edb/ref 17592186357391 13194139535609 true] [17592186357385 1089 "q-278837" 13194139535609 true] [17592186357385 1091 #edb/ref 17592