{aligned}| \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}0 & -4 \\\\ 1 & 2x\\end{aligned}|i-|\\begin{aligned}2 & -4 \\\\ -1 & 2x\\end{aligned}|j+|\\begin{aligned}2 & 0 \\\\ -1 & 1\\end{aligned}|k \\\\  & =(0+4)i-(4x-4)j+(2-0)k \\\\  & =⟨4,-4x+4,2⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, computing the magnitude, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|\\,a\\times b\\,| & =\\sqrt{{4}^{2}+(-4x+4)^{2}+{2}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{16+16{x}^{2}-32x+16+4} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{16{x}^{2}-32x+36}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLastly, we solve for $x$ the following equation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|\\,a\\times b\\,| & =2\\sqrt{5} \\\\ \\sqrt{16{x}^{2}-32x+36} & =2\\sqrt{5} \\\\ 16{x}^{2}-32x+36 & =20 \\\\ 16{x}^{2}-32x+16 & =0 \\\\ 16({x}^{2}-2x+1) & =0 \\\\ {x}^{2}-2x+1 & =0 \\\\ (x-1)^{2} & =0 \\\\ x-1 & =0 \\\\ x & =1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution is $x=1.$" 13194139535609 true] [17592186357401 1000 #edb/ref 17592186357402 13194139535609 true] [17592186357401 1000 #edb/ref 17592186357403 13194139535609 true] [17592186357401 1000 #edb/ref 17592186357404 13194139535609 true] [17592186357401 1000 #edb/ref 17592186357405 13194139535609 true] [17592186357401 1000 #edb/ref 17592186357406 13194139535609 true] [17592186357401 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535609 true] [17592186357401 1041 "selection" 13194139535609 true] [17592186357401 1104 #edb/ref 17592186357402 13194139535609 true] [17592186357401 1110 #uuid "e5b8d869-afc8-5fa7-86fa-be29fa526db1" 13194139535609 true] [17592186357402 1034 "x=1" 13194139535609 true] [17592186357402 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535609 true] [17592186357402 1111 #uuid "f3567fca-bf34-579f-8cfb-8b4963a5b388" 13194139535609 true] [17592186357403 1034 "x=-1,\\,2" 13194139535609 true] [17592186357403 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535609 true] [17592186357403 1111 #uuid "6330c1a6-6550-51da-87b2-2fdae01c9897" 13194139535609 true] [17592186357404 1034 "x=-1,4" 13194139535609 true] [17592186357404 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535609 true] [17592186357404 1111 #uuid "0da